-- migrate:up
-- Quick Start's everyday retail range: 166 widely stocked non-medicine
-- products for Kenyan pharmacies (baby & mother, personal care, sexual health,
-- first aid & devices, dental, skin care, supplements) — the PPB register lists
-- medicines only. Well-known brands in their common sizes; no reference prices
-- (each pharmacy prices its own). generic_name is the product type, so the
-- picker groups brands ("Baby diapers size 3 · 4 brands"). Categories are the
-- defaults (packages/core taxonomy). Existing rows are left as they are.
